# =============================================================================
# .trivyignore — Trivy vulnerability exceptions
#
# These CVEs have no fix available from Debian at time of writing.
# Status: affected / fix_deferred — no patched package exists.
# Review monthly and remove entries once Debian releases fixes.
#
# Added: 2026-04-03 (Phase 211 pipeline unblock)
# Review by: 2026-05-03
# =============================================================================

# GnuPG: Stack-based buffer overflow in tpm2daemon
# Status: affected (no Debian fix)
# Impact: Low — tpm2daemon not used in container workloads
CVE-2026-24882

# glibc: Denial of Service via iconv() function
# Status: fix_deferred (Debian tracking, no release yet)
CVE-2026-4046

# ncurses: Buffer overflow vulnerability
# Status: affected (no Debian fix)
# Impact: Low — ncurses not exposed to untrusted input in our containers
CVE-2025-69720

# nghttp2: Denial of Service via malformed HTTP/2
# Status: affected (no Debian fix)
CVE-2026-27135

# systemd: Arbitrary code execution or DoS
# Status: affected (no Debian fix)
# Impact: Low — systemd runs as init in host, not in container workloads
CVE-2026-29111

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Go binary CVEs — from compiled binaries bundled in base image, not our code.
# These are in Go runtime/libraries embedded in tools within python:3.12-slim.
# We cannot patch these without rebuilding the upstream binaries.
# Added: 2026-04-03 | Review by: 2026-05-03
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Moby/Docker: AuthZ plugin bypass with oversized request
# Source: Go binary in base image (docker engine components)
# Fix requires Docker 29.3.1 — not available in python:3.12-slim
CVE-2026-34040

# pgproto3/v2: PostgreSQL protocol vulnerability
# Status: affected (no fix available)
# Source: Go binary (likely from a bundled tool)
CVE-2026-32286

# grpc-go: Critical vulnerability in gRPC Go implementation
# Source: Go binary in base image
# Fix requires grpc v1.79.3 — not controllable from Python image
CVE-2026-33186

# Go stdlib: Incorrect parsing of IPv6 host literals in net/url
# Source: Go runtime v1.25.7 embedded in base image binaries
# Fix requires Go 1.25.8 — not controllable from Python image
CVE-2026-25679

